ping to commit rape.", "large_image": "qPkZwcfp3L5osqt5.png", "title": "Sicko Uber Driver Faces Life in Prison After Female Passenger Passed Out in His Car and He Refused to End the Ride * The Gateway Pundit * by Michael Schwarz, The Western Journal"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATodjt7n1", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 33, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8938203, "raw_content": "His Broadway show is funny.  But his ignorance is broadcast in his skit.  While he is telling a touching story of his life and turning tragedy to valuing family (as we all do), he lashes out at Trump for laughs.  Mostly about draft and war, but never in context.  \n\nWhen he talks about losing his Palisades home he asks \u201cwhy\u201d?  We all know why and it starts with Newsom and Bass.   When he talks about losing Rob Reiner he of course never mentions the brutal murder by Reiner\u2019s own son.  None of this would get a laugh.  He got a little laugh when he alluded to Biden\u2019s senility but there so much more material there.\n\nHe got laughs on Trump getting medical deferment from the Viet Nam war draft, like every male that age was doing.  And yet he praises Muhammed Ali for refusing to be inducted.  Cognizant dissonance, but for laughs.\n\nHe took a cheap shot saying the president at the time got us into the unnecessary VNW, kind of remind you of anyone?  Big laughs.  But doesn\u2019t say it was Kennedy and Johnson (democrats) that escalated the involvement that led to the draft.  Or that Trump has ended 8 wars so far and is ending the 50yr war with Iran right now.  No laughs in that.\n\nWish I had my MAGA hat on because I was third row center.  Now that would have been funny.\n\n", "author": "Grindelwald", "created": 1794575206032, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Grindelwald", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Billy Crystal is seriously TDS", "last_comment_created": 1794576692158, "content": "<p>His Broadway show is funny.  But his ignorance is broadcast in his skit.  While he is telling a touching story of his life and turning tragedy to valuing family (as we all do), he lashes out at Trump for laughs.  Mostly about draft and war, but never in context.</p>\n<p>When he talks about losing his Palisades home he asks \u201cwhy\u201d?  We all know why and it starts with Newsom and Bass.   When he talks about losing Rob Reiner he of course never mentions the brutal murder by Reiner\u2019s own son.  None of this would get a laugh.  He got a little laugh when he alluded to Biden\u2019s senility but there so much more material there.</p>\n<p>He got laughs on Trump getting medical deferment from the Viet Nam war draft, like every male that age was doing.  And yet he praises Muhammed Ali for refusing to be inducted.  Cognizant dissonance, but for laughs.</p>\n<p>He took a cheap shot saying the president at the time got us into the unnecessary VNW, kind of remind you of anyone?  Big laughs.  But doesn\u2019t say it was Kennedy and Johnson (democrats) that escalated the involvement that led to the draft.  Or that Trump has ended 8 wars so far and is ending the 50yr war with Iran right now.  No laughs in that.</p>\n<p>Wish I had my MAGA hat on because I was third row center.  Now that would have been funny.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 33, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text":